OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who feared losing leg raises
OL,4,Acare concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FHCRG Care Group acknowledged problems
OL,7,Fwhen its Single Point of Access (SPA)
OL,8,Fsystem was introduced in April and
OL,9,Fapologised to patients. However, it
OL,10,Fsaid performance had improved and care
OL,11,Fremained safe.
